---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../lib/constants';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy & Cookies — FourthWingDragon Fan Tools" description="How FourthWingDragon handles browser-based tools, analytics, potential Google AdSense cookies, Amazon affiliate links, and privacy inquiries." breadcrumbs={[{name:'Privacy',href:'/privacy/'}]}>
  <h1>Privacy and Cookies</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>This website has no accounts or login. Quiz answers and generated names remain in the current browser tab and are not saved in local storage. Reloading clears quiz progress. A recording from Microsoft Clarity can include text that is visible on the page.</p>
    <p>The optional book-alert form is separate. It sends only the email address you submit. The server forwards that address to Kit, which stores it so we can write when the next Empyrean book has a title or a release date, and when a Prime Video series has an air date. Quiz answers are not included. Kit’s privacy policy applies to the stored address.</p>
    <p>The quiz URL records the current step, without answers or a personal profile. Share your result can copy the match, open your device’s share sheet, or open X, Facebook, Tumblr, Reddit, WhatsApp or Bluesky with the text filled in. Download image and Share image build a picture in your browser. The site does not receive that file. Copy names writes generated names to your clipboard only. This site does not post any of these. A platform or app receives the text or picture only after you confirm it there.</p>
    <p>The site uses Plausible Analytics, which does not identify individual visitors, use advertising cookies, or store personal profiles. The site also uses Google Analytics 4. That tag sends page-view data to Google and stores analytics cookies in the browser. Google's privacy policy applies to that data. The site uses Microsoft Clarity. Clarity records page interactions, such as clicks and scrolling, and stores cookies in the browser. Microsoft's privacy policy applies to that data. Hosting infrastructure may process standard request logs. Google Search Console ownership is verified with a static HTML file.</p>
    <p>External destinations and dictionary links follow their own privacy policies. Read those policies before submitting information there.</p>
    <h2>Third-party advertising</h2>
    <p>Google AdSense is not currently enabled on this site. If Google AdSense is enabled, Google and its advertising partners may use cookies to provide personalized ads based on visits to this and other websites, subject to applicable consent requirements. You can review or change personalization preferences in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p>
    <h2>Amazon affiliate links</h2>
    <p>As an Amazon Associate and Etsy Affiliate, I earn from qualifying purchases. Amazon links are marked as sponsored and open in a new tab. Following a link takes you to Amazon, where its own privacy and cookie policies apply. Quiz answers and generated names are not included in these shopping links.</p>
    <h2>Effective date and contact</h2>
    <p>This privacy notice takes effect on <time datetime="2026-10-29">October 29, 2026</time>. {CONTACT_EMAIL && <>For privacy questions or requests, contact <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Include the relevant page URL and avoid sending sensitive personal information.</>}</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
